OL,3,GNEWSAMan believes missing family 'swept
OL,4,Aaway' in floods
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Sussex man searching for family
OL,7,Fmembers missing after the floods in
OL,8,FNepal says he now believes they will
OL,9,Fnot be found.
OL,11,FPramod Poudel, from Uckfield, travelled
OL,12,Fto Nepal after losing contact with his
OL,13,Fwife, mother, brother and uncle
OL,14,Ffollowing the disaster.
OL,16,FHe said relatives and other people from
OL,17,Fthe area where his family lived now
OL,18,Fbelieved they had been swept away by
OL,19,Ffloodwater. Funeral rituals are due to
OL,20,Fbegin on Wednesday and continue for
OL,21,Ffour days, he says.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
