OL,3,GNEWSAMan believes missing family 'swept
OL,4,Aaway' in floods
OL,5,
OL,6,FNepal's death toll has exceeded 1,000
OL,7,Fafter last week's devastating floods,
OL,8,Fand officials say about 4,000 are
OL,9,Fmissing.
